Z||000001||My7Fieros||06-02-2000||03:11 AM||||OK, Im new at this, so my reply prob. wont help much, but who knows? Want a faster fiero? Dump the clunky 4 banger and get a 6! ha ha..Just kidding! I saw on a website somewhere where someone turbo'd there 4 banger...cant quite remember which site though. I do remember that they used the turbo off an older model Pontiac Sunbird though! Also, as far as the tires go..its prob. a no-go. If you go too much wider, you'll never clear the front wheel wells on turns at best. You can up the rim size, say to a 17 or poss. even an 18 inch..w/ appropriate width tires for those size wheels. 10 on 100 bolt pattern. Check around and see through tire stores.||||reg||1
